<h1>Import Transformation</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Transformations &gt; Import</b></span>.</p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Import Transformation</b></span> allows you to import co-ordinate systems from other software. Its functionality is duplicated in <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Open</b></span> command but for convenience it is made as separate command in <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Transformation menu</b></span>.</p>
<p>Here follows a list of currently supported co-ordinate systems file formats:</p>
